    "decision": "Win [♦] tricks either with top [♦]s or by staying void and trumping; it shapes when to keep or shed [♦]s.",
    "opponent": "Revealed on the first such win; opponents avoid leading [♦] into a void.",
    "rationale": "Both lines of a [♦] plan score here (honors win the suit, a void trumps it), which fixes the length line's main threat of [♦]s being trumped.",
